   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The superlative",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed with **le/la/les** + **plus** or **moins** + adjective: **C'est le plus grand** (it is the biggest). **C'est le moins cher** (it is the cheapest).",
      "The article changes with gender: **la plus jolie**, **la moins chère**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The best and the best way",
     "texto": [
      "**Le meilleur / la meilleure** agrees with the noun: **C'est la meilleure veste du magasin**. To say that something is done in the best way, use **le mieux**: **Tu chantes le mieux** (you are the one who sings best)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
